mapping "W215.1" source="W215" target="220573001" relationship=partial_overlap {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W215 SNOMED CT 220573001 is the Swedish ICD-10-SE extension of WHO W21 (Striking against or
        struck by sports equipment) restricted to a trade/service place. Target covers exactly the place
        axis. Confidence (low): the place dimension is well captured, but the source is a Swedish
        extension with no ICD-10 WHO crosswalk and the activity dimension is unspecified.
        """
}
mapping "W2150.1" source="W2150" target="220573001" relationship=partial_overlap {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2150 = Swedish ICD-10-SE extension of W21 (sports equipment injury) restricted to (a)
        trade/service place and (b) sport activity. SNOMED CT has no single concept capturing both axes.
        Target 40420572 SNOMED CT 220573001 443786003 covers the place axis (partial); target 40483249
        covers the activity axis (partial). Both are partial — neither subsumes the other. Confidence
        each: Swedish-extension source, no crosswalk, defensible lead but real doubt.
        """
}
